  "note": "Extracted by hand from the brochure's 81V/81 schematic. The header's model and model orifice columns fold into the printed designators, 81V for the elastomer plug set to 232 psi and 81 for the o-ring seat to 500 psi, both at the 0.394 inch orifice. The trim characters DD and VV read differently per model, plug forms on the 81V and o-ring forms on the 81, both readings in the labels; the Kalrez CC is the 81's alone. The setpoint ladder splits by model as printed, the 81 rows named 81-ORING on the sheet. The sizing worksheet pages are an order form, not a matrix, and take no slot.",
